### health
GET http://localhost:8000/health

### get all authors
GET http://localhost:8000/author

### get author by id
GET http://localhost:8000/author/1

### get author by id (does not exist)
GET http://localhost:8000/author/100

### create author
POST http://localhost:8000/author
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "first_name": "jonas",
  "middle_name": null,
  "last_name": "ha"
}

### update author
PUT http://localhost:8000/author/12
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "first_name": "j",
  "middle_name": "d",
  "last_name": "ha"
}

### delete author
DELETE http://localhost:8000/author/12